+2,481,866 ms, bringing this lab to 48,869,946 / 64,800,000 ms and the shared ledger
+to 697,025,526 / the verified 722,400,000 ms allowance. The foreign-reported
+744,000,000 ms field is preserved but not adopted. Physical free space is
+30,117,130,240 bytes internally and 172,482,707,456 bytes on the owner SSD; the
+physical reserve and 128 MiB stop margin remain. Model, build and review times
+are nested breakdowns of elapsed work, not extra cumulative charges. Subsequent
+fit and delivery time continues from that cursor.
+
+The [shared work card](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/973#issuecomment-5856586066)
+records this fixed selection. References #973 and #820. Actual fitted output,
+source-stratified tradeoffs and protected delivery status will be recorded
+separately; the broader geometric attention, useful inference, prose, chat and
+reasoning programme remains open.
